From eab0d64bd4b0fb63b35609c9f22f09c6adda07cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joebereczki <41107035-joebereczki@users.noreply.replit.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 02:31:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 210/244] Improve alert system to provide more meaningful
 trading signals

Update `ig-signal-monitor.cjs` to introduce new signal types (trend, reversal, session high/low, volatility) with configurable thresholds and cooldowns. Enhance `badgeType` function in `ig-dashboard-backup/ig-dashboard-2026-03-02-v4.html` to correctly map new signal types to visual badges. Also, update script versions in multiple HTML files within `dist/control-ui/`.

